# Maple: Maple Programming Guide (Maplesoft); requirements/languages/maple.md
name     maple mpl
keyword  proc end if then elif else fi for from to by while do od local global return in and or not
keyword  module export option use try catch finally break next
builtin  true false FAIL Pi I infinity diff int simplify solve expand evalf plot seq sum print
line-comment   #
block-comment  (* *)
string   " "  : escapes
string   ` `
operators  +-*/^=<>:;$@!.,|
calls
